g>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/997407-npc-sunny-and-the-kid?p=997456#post997456\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was thinking that too, but I ran out of creativity juice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Think of falling water and the underground.<br /> <br /> Think de-termination.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T19:34:56-07:00","id":997509,"title":"","content":"<i>And you know what the best part of all this is?<br /> You'll come back.<br /> <b><span style=\"color:#FFD700\">Again.</span></b><br /> And <span style=\"color:#FFD700\"><b>again.</b></span><br /> And <span style=\"color:#8B4513\"><u><b>again!</b></u></span><br /> <br /> Because you want a &quot;<b><span style=\"color:#FFD700\">happy ending</span>.</b>&quot;<br /> Because you &quot;<b><span style=\"color:#FFD700\">believe you can be human</span>.</b>&quot;<br /> Because you &quot;<b><span style=\"color:#FFD700\">never give up</span>.</b>&quot;<br /> <br /> Isn't that delicious?<br /> Your <b>&quot;<span style=\"color:#FFD700\">Bestowment</span>...&quot;</b><br /> The power that let you get this far...<br /> It's gonna be your downfall!</i><br /> <br /> <b>The Kid's Bestowment: But it Refused</b><br /> The Kid doesn't die. Ever. If there's even a shred of hope remaining, they can come back swinging. But this isn't an enlightening journey to the Underworld like the Revivification Bestowment. Their body simply refuses to die, drawing on the power of Flux to reinvigorate itself.<br /> <br /> When the Kid marks their last Health box with aggravated damage, it immediately triggers a Praxidikae Firestorm centered on them. At the conclusion of the Firestorm, they may spend a Willpower <i>dot </i>to immediately revivify, regain Health equal to their Azoth, and gain two dots in a Dread Power of the Storyteller's choosing. This triggers a Wasteland as normal for reviving.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Unexpected rules consequence: the nature of Lilithian Firestorms and Sunny's Health means it won't survive the Kid's Bestowment if it's nearby, which it almost definitely would be. If you want to give the poor little flower a slim chance of hanging on, you might grant it Stamina 2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":2207,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","user":"Caladriu","date":". 11-02-2016, 10:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpa